	"VersionName": "0.16.0",
	"FriendlyName": "Monolith Flow",
	"Description": "Sibling plugin bridging the MothCocoon Flow plugin into the Monolith MCP registry. Registers the `flow` namespace (flow_query tool): asset listing, graph walks + analysis (execution reachability, one-call graph export, asset diff), cross-asset reverse lookups, a node-class registry, full graph authoring (create/add/edit/wire/remove/comment, transactional), a layered auto-layout formatter, data validation, and PIE runtime introspection - backed by a Flow indexer feeding Monolith's central SQLite project index. Compiles to an inactive stub when the Flow plugin is absent.",
	"Category": "Editor",
	"CreatedBy": "Arystan Kudaibergenov",
